  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Department of Correctional Services to manage the estate and corrections system, through the development and implementation of training, policies and standard operating procedures and the operationalisation of rehabilitation plans.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Support to the Department of Correctional Services to manage the estate and corrections system, through the development and implementation of training, policies and standard operating procedures and the operationalisation of rehabilitation plans. is a component of Jamaica Strategic Corrections Partnership Project  reported by FCDO with a funding type of 108 - Non-budget support financial aid and a budget of &#xA3;280,000. It works in the following sector(s): Security system management and reform.</narrative>
  </description>
